additional_comments_on_reviewer_discussi.value:
The authors addressed the reviewers' concerns by providing additional results, which include
* Various quantitative results and class-agnostic segmentation results on the validation set of ScanNet and S3DIS Area5;
* Quantitative results on the test set of our synthetic dataset;
* Ablation results of different types of superpoints,  different threshold values, varying numbers of parallel trajectories, and attention blocks in the object-centric network;
* Analysis of the number and accuracy of discovered objects over a certain number of epochs;
* Evaluation of the object-centric network for shape reconstruction.
